One CSS rule, present in <head> from first paint (in the stats embed's own CSS, or in 'GBM - Readability and speed fixes v1' 9c457b7a without touching 756655cf):
html.gbm-sp-app:has(body > #gbm-stats) #SITE_CONTAINER{position:absolute!important;top:0!important;left:0!important;right:0!important}
This parks the hidden zero-height native container at the top, so Wix's scroll target becomes y=0. Longer term: give stats its own Wix page (the embed already lists /florida-football-stats, which is a 404 today) so the Groups app is not loaded at all.

